      "title": "Humana's CenterWell Expansion Gets a Boost From BlackRock's Capital",
      "summary": "Humana Inc. (HUM) is forming a joint venture with BlackRock's HPS Investment Partners to own nearly 150 CenterWell Senior Primary Care clinics. BlackRock will acquire the existing equity stake valued at approximately $2.8 billion and hold majority ownership, while CenterWell retains minority ownership and operational control. The partnership is expected to reduce Humana's balance sheet liabilities, provide greater financial flexibility, and accelerate clinic expansion. The transaction is set to close in Q4 2026 without materially affecting 2026 earnings guidance.",
